        "text": "Working with the Virtual Machine\nWhen you have your virtual machine running, you\u2019ll want to become familiar with\na few VirtualBox commands. You\u2019ve already seen the importance of the right-side\nCtrl button. That\u2019s how you grab and release control over the keyboard and mouse\nin your virtual machine.\nThree menu bar items can also help you in your virtual machine environment \u2014\nMachine, View, and Devices.\nEsta secci\u00f3n contiene las siguientes subsecciones\n\u2022 The Machine menu area\n\u2022 The View menu\n\u2022 The Devices menu area\nSi deseas explorar cualquiera de estas subsecciones, puedes pregunt\u00e1rmelo directamente.",
